      "title": {
        "en": "Urgent surgical outcomes and critical care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners credit the surgical team with saving animals facing pyometra, urinary blockages, and foreign body obstructions. Clients value timely interventions during life-threatening crises. Conversely, several negative reviews describe fatal complications or misdiagnoses, leaving some owners questioning treatment decisions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Transparent pricing and payment assistance options"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight affordable surgery rates and accessible payment plans compared to traditional emergency hospitals. Many note that transparent estimates helped them manage urgent procedures. However, critical reviewers report unexpected diagnostic add-ons, markup on takeaway medications, and high non-refundable surgery deposits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate bedside manner from veterinarians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently praise Dr. Gallegos and the technical staff for empathetic care and warmth during distressing visits. Pet owners feel supported when facing difficult medical choices. A few patrons note occasional friction with front desk receptionists, but the core medical team receives strong personal appreciation."
      }
    }
  ],
